WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.772 --> 00:00:15.499
Roxy made sure no one was watching her.

2
00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:18.661
Then she sneaked around the school building.

3
00:00:21.642 --> 00:00:23.283
In an instant she was Rocket Girl!

4
00:00:23.303 --> 00:00:28.486
"It's time to find out what happened to Principal Penn," said Roxy.

5
00:00:29.747 --> 00:00:31.328
She blasted off into the sky.

6
00:00:33.292 --> 00:00:34.732
"Look! It's Rocket Girl!"

7
00:00:35.113 --> 00:00:35.693
said Mara.

8
00:00:35.713 --> 00:00:38.714
"I wonder where she's going," said Jack.

9
00:00:39.774 --> 00:00:40.774
Terrell looked around.

10
00:00:40.794 --> 00:00:43.675
"Does anyone know where Roxy went?"

11
00:00:43.995 --> 00:00:44.495
he asked.

12
00:00:49.857 --> 00:00:51.638
Roxy landed at Police Headquarters.

13
00:00:54.778 --> 00:00:55.979
She found Detective Smith.

14
00:00:56.819 --> 00:00:59.560
He was sitting at his desk, watching something on his computer.

15
00:01:00.764 --> 00:01:02.585
"Are you watching a TV show?"

16
00:01:02.885 --> 00:01:03.685
Roxy laughed.

17
00:01:03.705 --> 00:01:08.127
"Aren't you supposed to be solving crimes?"

18
00:01:08.187 --> 00:01:09.428
Detective Smith frowned.

19
00:01:09.448 --> 00:01:12.209
"I'm not watching a TV show.

20
00:01:13.089 --> 00:01:15.010
I'm watching video from a traffic camera."

21
00:01:15.030 --> 00:01:19.152
"I got a call from Mayor Bloom," said Roxy.

22
00:01:19.172 --> 00:01:22.193
"He said Principal Penn disappeared."

23
00:01:22.213 --> 00:01:26.195
"She didn't disappear," said Detective Smith.

24
00:01:26.215 --> 00:01:27.856
"She left town.

25
00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:32.389
In fact, all the teachers from Metro City Elementary School left town.

26
00:01:33.329 --> 00:01:33.829
Watch this."

27
00:01:35.590 --> 00:01:37.731
Roxy watched the video from the traffic camera.

28
00:01:38.591 --> 00:01:41.272
The video showed lots of cars and buses driving by.

29
00:01:41.292 --> 00:01:46.433
"Hey! That was Principal Penn!"

30
00:01:46.793 --> 00:01:47.433
said Roxy.

31
00:01:47.453 --> 00:01:50.334
"Keep watching," said Detective Smith.

32
00:01:52.095 --> 00:01:53.635
Next Miss Apricot drove by.

33
00:01:55.216 --> 00:01:55.736
Then Mr.

34
00:01:55.756 --> 00:01:56.556
Green drove by.

35
00:01:57.836 --> 00:02:01.119
One after another, all the teachers from Roxy's school drove by.

36
00:02:01.139 --> 00:02:04.622
"That's West Street," said Detective Smith.

37
00:02:04.642 --> 00:02:08.005
"It leads out of Metro City and into the mountains."

38
00:02:08.025 --> 00:02:11.548
"So all the teachers drove to the mountains?"

39
00:02:11.968 --> 00:02:12.628
asked Roxy.

40
00:02:12.648 --> 00:02:15.731
"I think so," said Detective Smith.

41
00:02:15.751 --> 00:02:18.033
"But it doesn't make any sense.

42
00:02:19.234 --> 00:02:21.376
Why would teachers do that on a school day?

43
00:02:22.256 --> 00:02:23.517
They're supposed to be teaching!"

44
00:02:24.819 --> 00:02:26.240
Roxy watched the video again.

45
00:02:27.808 --> 00:02:29.129
This time she noticed something.

46
00:02:32.431 --> 00:02:34.912
All the teachers were wearing the same star buttons!

47
00:02:35.953 --> 00:02:37.073
And the buttons were glowing.

48
00:02:37.093 --> 00:02:40.715
"I've seen those buttons before!"

49
00:02:41.015 --> 00:02:41.696
cried Roxy.

50
00:02:41.716 --> 00:02:46.919
"Mr. Sweeps, the substitute principal, was giving them to all the students!"

51
00:02:48.339 --> 00:02:49.500
"Are you sure about that?"

52
00:02:49.820 --> 00:02:50.761
asked Detective Smith.

53
00:02:54.923 --> 00:02:56.304
is very suspicious.

54
00:02:57.464 --> 00:02:59.905
We'll have to Rocket Girl?"

55
00:03:04.926 --> 00:03:07.927
In a flash Roxy was back at Metro City Elementary School.

56
00:03:08.987 --> 00:03:10.448
She burst through the front doors.

57
00:03:10.468 --> 00:03:12.428
"Where's Mr.

58
00:03:12.508 --> 00:03:14.108
Sweeps?" Roxy demanded.

59
00:03:15.389 --> 00:03:16.389
The hallway was empty.

60
00:03:16.409 --> 00:03:19.050
"Hello?" Roxy called.

61
00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:21.290
No one answered.

62
00:03:23.931 --> 00:03:25.391
Roxy ran into her classroom.

63
00:03:26.292 --> 00:03:26.992
No one was there.

64
00:03:28.828 --> 00:03:30.510
No one was in the principal's office either.

65
00:03:31.972 --> 00:03:34.475
Roxy soon realized the whole school was empty.

66
00:03:34.495 --> 00:03:36.838
"Where did everyone go?"

67
00:03:37.258 --> 00:03:37.779
she wondered.

68
00:03:37.799 --> 00:03:40.402
"I'll use my super hearing."

69
00:03:43.185 --> 00:03:48.471
A second later she heard something—something very strange!
